      "text": "if ye will receive it, this is Elias, Matt. 11:14. Some say that thou art … Elias, Matt. 16:14 (Mark 8:28; Luke 9:19). there appeared unto them Moses and Elias, Matt. 17:3 (Mark 9:4; Luke 9:30). I say unto you, That Elias is come, Matt. 17:12 (Mark 9:13). This man calleth for Elias, Matt. 27:47 (Mark 15:35). Others said, That it is Elias, Mark 6:15 (Luke 9:8). go before him in the spirit and power of Elias, Luke 1:17. consume them, even as Elias did, Luke 9:54. Art thou Elias? … I am not, John 1:21. scripture saith of Elias, Rom. 11:2. Elias was a man subject to like passions, James 5:17.",
